Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 17:06:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Add input.run local-control action

Adds an input.run action and `warpctrl input run <text>` that executes a
command in a terminal pane. It uses execute_command_or_set_pending, so a
command sent to a pane whose shell is still bootstrapping is queued and runs
once the shell is ready. Text is validated like input.insert/input.replace
(no newlines or control characters).

Upstream deliberately excluded input.run; this removes it from the excluded
action and CLI route test lists. Local fork only.
